  "description": {
   "en": "[I want power. The power to protect the things important to me. The power to prevent them from being taken away.] \n\nI was reincarnated as the villainous aristocrat, Vanitas, and decided to defy my destined destruction.\nBy using the absolute power of Domination Magic, I will protect the heroines who were originally meant to be taken away, and push forward on my path to the top of the magical world.\n\nA Villainous Aristocrat x Harem fantasy that defies a doomed fate!"
  },
